1. PERMISSIVE COMMERCIAL USE (ZERO ROYALTIES, UNLIMITED REVENUE):
   You are granted full, royalty-free commercial rights to deploy, serve, monetize, 
   integrate, fine-tune, and build products/services upon the Ypru Model Weights 
   and architecture. There are no revenue caps, no recurring fees, and no upfront costs.

2. MANDATORY ATTRIBUTION:
   Any public deployment, SaaS interface, commercial application, derivative fine-tune, 
   or redistributed release incorporating this Model MUST provide prominent attribution:
   
   "Based on the Ypru Foundation Architecture developed by Yaqgu (https://yaqgu.com)"

3. NO STANDALONE WEIGHT RESALE:
   You may monetize applications, APIs, fine-tunes, and services that utilize this Model. 
   However, you may not repackage, rebrand, and sell the raw unmodified base weights file 
   ("model.safetensors") as a standalone paid binary without substantial technical modifications.

4. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY & PROPRIETARY TRAINING FORTRESS:
   While the published model weights and inference runtime definitions are open and commercially 
   free under Apache 2.0, the proprietary spectral optimization heuristics (Muon Newton-Schulz 
   hyper-schedules), continuous data curriculum mixture streaming code, and offline latent 
   distillation pipelines remain internal trade secrets of Yaqgu Technologies.
